  "name": "莉奈娅的博物图鉴",
  "desc": "莉奈娅亲手制作的博物图鉴，记录了她的观察发现。",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/04/03/939339d08b245a10058d8d9a17e561c3_7234500658881746029.png",
