    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "教程"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/237301566/3d114f95fba74ca8cddf89ea0eb6fae2_9052444015672223558.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "完成魔神任务「迫近的客星」，并提升角色好感等级至1/3/5级，可开启莉奈娅的博物图鉴补完计划。需要注意，只有完成上一类别的特别授课，才能继续下一类别的调查。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/237301566/b6f88efb1bbff0d7e5cf77dc153ea6e1_4573307786774365225.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "每个类别的补完计划中，包含四个普通调查任务及一次特别授课。完成该类别下的全部调查任务，则可开启特别授课。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/11/237301566/852af1b51c2d3d50dd44844c4866cace_5437375725926577914.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "完成特别授课后，将会获得装扮奖励。在徽章搭配界面中，可以为背包替换装扮徽章，以及背包独占或共享。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
